Cell["\<\
Vertices, edges, faces and Euler characteristic of the five Platonic solids, \
three flat tori and two hyperbolic maps.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"b9ed0151-cdf5-4a8a-a890-999c36b02833"],

